#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:2
msgid "Trust"
msgstr "Trust"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Trust section is where credentials, SSH keypairs, and SSL certificates "
"are stored. In addition, related integrations to outside technologies can be"
" made in this section as well. Integration types include |morpheus| Cypher "
"and Hashicorp Vault for externalized credential storage. Continue onto the "
"next section for more on standing up an external Cypher credential store."
msgstr ""
"El Trust sección es donde credentials, SSH keypairs, y SSL certificados son "
"stored. Además, related integrations a outside technologies puede be made en"
" este sección también. Integración tipos incluir |morpheus| Cypher y "
"Hashicorp Vault para externalized credential storage. Continuar onto el "
"siguiente sección para más en standing up un externo Cypher credential "
"store."

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:7
msgid "Credentials"
msgstr "Credenciales"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:9
msgid ""
"The credentials section allows for various credential types to be securely "
"stored and called back when necessary, such as when creating new "
"integrations with Cloud accounts or other outside technologies. Credentials "
"can also be used to populate REST-based Option Lists sourced from data "
"behind an authentication wall, as well as to run automation Tasks on remote "
"targets that require authentication. Credentials can be securely stored "
"internally on the appliance or stored in an external Cypher integration, "
"more information about setting up and integrating with an external Cypher "
"store are in the next section. The following credential pair types are "
"currently supported:"
msgstr ""
"El credentials sección permite para varios credential tipos a be securely "
"stored y llamado back cuando necessary, como cuando creating nuevo "
"integrations con Nube accounts o otro outside technologies. Credenciales "
"también puede ser utilizado para populate REST-based Option Lists sourced "
"desde datos behind un autenticación wall, así como a ejecutar automation "
"Tareas en remoto targets ese requerir autenticación. Credenciales puede be "
"securely stored internally en el appliance o stored en un externo Cypher "
"integration, más información acerca de setting up y integrating con un "
"externo Cypher store son en el siguiente sección. Lo siguiente credential "
"pair tipos son actualmente soportado:"

