"En el credentials sección, I tienen lo siguiente opciones: Creating (y "
"usando) un nuevo Nombre de usuario y Contraseña credential establecer (cual "
"incluye el opción a guardar internally o a un externo Cypher store), "
"choosing un previamente-stored credential establecer, o simply entering my "
"credentials locally y no saving them para reuse."

msgid ".. image:: images/infrastructure/trust/useCredentials.png"
msgstr ".. imagen:: imágenes/infrastructure/trust/useCredentials.png"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:38
msgid "OAuth 2.0 Credentials"
msgstr "OAuth 2.0 Credenciales"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:40
msgid ""
"|morpheus| supports storage of credential sets for retrieving temporary "
"access tokens, through OAuth 2.0, and using the tokens to access some "
"resource. These credential sets can be used with REST-type Option Lists to "
"retrieve information behind this type of authentication wall. Once stored, "
"the credential can be used with as many Option Lists as needed and "
"potentially in other areas of the product in the future."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| soporta storage de credential establece para retrieving temporary"
" acceso tokens, a través de OAuth 2.0, y usando el tokens a acceso algunos "
"recurso. Estos credential establece se puede usar con REST-tipo Option Lists"
" a retrieve información behind este tipo de autenticación wall. Once stored,"
" el credential se puede usar con como muchos Option Lists según sea "
"necesario y potentially en otro areas del product en el future."

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:42
msgid ""
"To create a new credential set, click :guilabel:`+ ADD` and then select "
"\"OAuth 2.0\". Complete the following, not all fields are present or "
"required in every context:"
msgstr ""
"Para crear un nuevo credential establecer, click :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR` y "
"entonces seleccionar \"OAuth 2.0\". Completo el siguiente, no todos campos "
"son present o requerido en cada context:"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:44
msgid ""
"**CREDENTIAL STORE:** Select \"Internal\" or an integrated external Cypher "
"store (if any). See the next section for instructions on standing up and "
"integrating with an external Cypher store"
msgstr ""
"**CREDENTIAL STORE:** Seleccionar \"Interno\" o un integrated externo Cypher"
" store (si cualquier). Consulte la siguiente sección para instructions en "
"standing up y integrating con un externo Cypher store"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:48
msgid "**GRANT TYPE:** Client Credentials or Password Credentials"
msgstr "**GRANT TYPE:** Cliente Credenciales o Contraseña Credenciales"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:49
msgid "**ACCESS TOKEN URL:** The authorization server's token endpoint"
msgstr "**ACCESS TOKEN URL:** El autorización servidor's token endpoint"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:50
msgid ""
"**CLIENT ID:** The client ID for an app registered with the target service"
msgstr ""
"**CLIENT ID:** El cliente ID para un app registered con el destino servicio"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:51
msgid ""
"**CLIENT SECRET:** The client secret, often needed when requesting access "
"outside the context of a specific user"
msgstr ""
"**CLIENT SECRET:** El cliente secret, a menudo necesario cuando requesting "
"acceso outside el context de un específico usuario"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:52
msgid ""
"**USERNAME:** (Only present with \"Password Credentials\" Grant Type) The "
"username for a user with target data access"
msgstr ""
"**USERNAME:** (Solo present con \"Contraseña Credenciales\" Grant Tipo) El "
"nombre de usuario para un usuario con destino datos acceso"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:53
msgid ""
"**PASSWORD:** (Only present with \"Password Credentials\" Grant Type) The "
"password for the user indicated above"
msgstr ""
"**PASSWORD:** (Solo present con \"Contraseña Credenciales\" Grant Tipo) El "
"contraseña para el usuario indicated arriba"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:54
msgid "**SCOPE:** The scope of access requested to the target resource"
msgstr "**SCOPE:** El scope de acceso requested al destino recurso"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:55
msgid ""
"**CLIENT AUTHENTICATION:** \"Send as basic auth header\" or \"Send client "
"credentials in body\" - Indicates how |morpheus| should issue the token "
"received in requests to the target resource"
msgstr ""
"**CLIENT AUTHENTICATION:** \"Enviar como basic auth header\" o \"Enviar "
"cliente credentials en body\" - Indicates cómo |morpheus| debería problema "
"el token received en solicitudes al destino recurso"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:57
msgid "Once done, click :guilabel:`ADD CREDENTIALS`."
msgstr "Once done, click :guilabel:`ADD CREDENTIALS`."

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:59
msgid ""
"With the OAuth 2.0 credential set stored, they can be set on REST-type "
"Option Lists to source data from behind a compatible authentication wall. "
"With a REST-type Option List open (|LibOptOpt|), click the CREDENTIALS "
"dropdown and select the credential set you've created. Alternatively, you "
"can add a credential set directly in the add/edit Option List modal if "
"needed. Option Lists can be associated with Select List or Typeahead-type "
"Inputs and applied to Layouts, Instance Types, Workflows, and more to allow "
"for customization at provision or Workflow execution time. Additional "
"details on creating Option Lists can be found in the Library section of "
"|morpheus| docs."
msgstr ""
"Con el OAuth 2.0 credential establecer stored, they se puede establecer en "
"REST-tipo Option Lists a origen datos desde behind un compatible "
"autenticación wall. Con un REST-tipo Option List abrir (|LibOptOpt|), click "
"el CREDENTIALS dropdown y seleccionar el credential establecer you've "
"creado. Alternatively, you puede agregar un credential establecer "
"directamente en el agregar/editar Option List modal si es necesario. Option "
"Lists puede be asociado con Seleccionar List o Typeahead-tipo Inputs y "
"applied a Layouts, Instancia Tipos, Flujos de trabajo, y más a permitir para"
" customization en provision o Flujo de trabajo execution tiempo. Adicional "
"details en creating Option Lists se puede encontrar en el Biblioteca sección"
" de |morpheus| docs."

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:70
msgid "Integrating Hashicorp Vault"
msgstr "Integrating Hashicorp Vault"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:72
msgid ""
"The Hashicorp Vault integration is not included with |morpheus| by default. "
"Download the plugin from |morpheus| `Exchange "
"<https://share.morpheusdata.com/>`_ and add the plugin to |morpheus| through"
" the `Plugins "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/administration/integrations/integrations.html#plugins>`_"
" section. This allows users to store credential sets completely outside of "
"|morpheus| and in Hashicorp Vault, which may be required by your "
"organization's IT policies."
msgstr ""
"El Hashicorp Vault integration es no incluido con |morpheus| por defecto. "
"Descargar el plugin desde |morpheus| `Exchange "
"<https://share.morpheusdata.com/>`_ y agregar el plugin a |morpheus| a "
"través de el `Plugins "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/administration/integrations/integrations.html#plugins>`_"
" sección. Este permite usuarios a store credential establece completely "
"outside de |morpheus| y en Hashicorp Vault, cual puede ser requerido por su "
"organization's IT políticas."

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:74
msgid ""
"The plugin space is universal and not specific to Tenants. If Subtenant "
"users have access to |AdmIntPlu|, any integrated plugins will be available "
"in all Tenants across the appliance. In most cases, it makes sense to "
"restrict access to this section from Subtenant users through the associated "
"Tenant Role. Instead integrate plugins from the Primary Tenant and expose "
"them to various Subtenants as needed."
msgstr ""
"El plugin space es universal y no específico a Inquilinos. Si Subtenant "
"usuarios tienen acceso a |AdmIntPlu|, cualquier integrated plugins será be "
"disponible en todos Inquilinos a través de el appliance. En más cases, it "
"hace sense a restrict acceso a este sección desde Subtenant usuarios a "
"través de el associated Inquilino Rol. Instead integrate plugins desde el "
"Primario Inquilino y expose them a varios Subtenants según sea necesario."

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:76
msgid ""
"Once downloaded, plugins are added to |morpheus| in |AdmIntPlu|. Simply "
"browse your local filesystem for the JAR file downloaded from |morpheus| "
"Exchange and its capabilities will immediately be added to the appliance. "
"After adding the plugin, configure access for the plugin to your Vault "
"server. Do this by clicking the Edit (pencil) button in the row for the "
"Vault plugin. Supply a URL for your Vault server and an access token, then "
"save your changes."
msgstr ""
"Once downloaded, plugins son agregado a |morpheus| en |AdmIntPlu|. Simply "
"browse su local filesystem para el JAR archivo downloaded desde |morpheus| "
"Exchange y su capabilities será immediately be agregado al appliance. "
"Después de adding el plugin, configure acceso para el plugin a su Vault "
"servidor. Do este por clicking el Editar (pencil) botón en el row para el "
"Vault plugin. Supply un URL para su Vault servidor y un acceso token, "
"entonces guardar su cambios."

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:78
msgid ""
"When creating a Vault integration, it's recommended that you use a long-"
"lived token. If the token suddenly becomes invalid, |morpheus| will be "
"unable to write new credential sets to Vault and will be unable to edit or "
"delete any existing ones. Additionally, you won't be able to use Vault-"
"stored credential sets elsewhere in |morpheus|, such as when creating new "
"Cloud integrations or populating REST-based Option Lists which require "
"authentication. Should this happen, simply obtain a new token, edit the "
"Vault integration, update the token, and save your changes."
msgstr ""
"Cuando creating un Vault integration, it's recommended ese you usar un "
"largo-lived token. Si el token suddenly becomes inválido, |morpheus| será be"
" unable a write nuevo credential establece a Vault y será be unable a editar"
" o eliminar cualquier existente ones. Adicionalmente, you won't be able a "
"usar Vault-stored credential establece elsewhere en |morpheus|, como cuando "
"creating nuevo Nube integrations o populating REST-based Option Lists cual "
"requerir autenticación. Debería este happen, simply obtain un nuevo token, "
"editar el Vault integration, update el token, y guardar su cambios."

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:80
msgid ""
"With the plugin added, a new integration type will appear in |InfTruInt|. "
"Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`, then \"Hashicorp Vault Credentials\" to get "
"started. The fields in the list below are available for configuration but "
"it's possible that no configuration will be necessary. If you do not enter a"
" new API URL and TOKEN value, these are taken from the plugin configuration "
"set a moment ago. Similarly, The Vault Secret Engine and Secret Path can be "
"left at default values (or empty) if those values are acceptable. If you "
"need to override the defaults or the URL/token set on the plugin, you may do"
" so here."
msgstr ""
"Con el plugin agregado, un nuevo integration tipo será aparecer en "
"|InfTruInt|. Click :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR`, entonces \"Hashicorp Vault "
"Credenciales\" a obtener iniciado. El campos en el lista a continuación "
"están disponibles para configuración pero it's possible ese no configuración"
" será be necessary. Si you do no ingresar un nuevo API URL y TOKEN valor, "
"estos son taken desde el plugin configuración establecer un moment ago. "
"Similarly, El Vault Secret Engine y Secret Ruta puede be left en "
"predeterminado valores (o vacío) si esos valores son acceptable. Si you "
"necesita a override el defaults o el URL/token establecer en el plugin, you "
"puede do así aquí."

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:82
msgid "**NAME:** A friendly name for the Vault integration in |morpheus|"
msgstr "**NAME:** Un friendly nombre para el Vault integration en |morpheus|"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:83
msgid ""
"**ENABLED:** When marked, this Vault integration will be available to have "
"credentials written to it"
msgstr ""
"**ENABLED:** Cuando marked, este Vault integration será be disponible a "
"tienen credentials written a it"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:84
msgid ""
"**API URL:** The URL for the Vault server (ex. http://xx.xx.xx.xx:8200)"
msgstr ""
"**API URL:** El URL para el Vault servidor (ex. http://xx.xx.xx.xx:8200)"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:85
msgid "**TOKEN:** A valid API token for the server (see note below)"
msgstr ""
"**TOKEN:** Un válido API token para el servidor (ver nota a continuación)"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:86
msgid ""
"**HASHICORP VAULT SECRET ENGINE:** Select KV Engine version 1 or 2, "
"additional engines may be available in the future"
msgstr ""
"**HASHICORP VAULT SECRET ENGINE:** Seleccionar KV Engine versión 1 o 2, "
"adicional engines puede be disponible en el future"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:87
msgid ""
"**ENGINE MOUNT:** If desired, enter a custom engine mount. By default, if "
"left empty, credentials are written to the \"secret/\" engine mount"
msgstr ""
"**ENGINE MOUNT:** Si desired, ingresar un personalizado engine mount. Por "
"defecto, si left vacío, credentials son written al \"secret/\" engine mount"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:88
msgid ""
"**SECRET PATH:** If desired, enter a custom path and |morpheus| will write "
"new credential sets to that path. By default, if left empty, new credentials"
" are written to \"morpheus-credentials/\""
msgstr ""
"**SECRET PATH:** Si desired, ingresar un personalizado ruta y |morpheus| "
"será write nuevo credential establece a ese ruta. Por defecto, si left "
"vacío, nuevo credentials son written a \"morpheus-credentials/\""

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:90
msgid "When done, click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`."
msgstr "Cuando done, click :guilabel:`GUARDAR CAMBIOS`."

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:92
msgid ""
"With the above process finished, this Vault integration will be available as"
" a storage target when creating new credential sets. In |InfTruCre|, after "
"clicking :guilabel:`+ ADD` and selecting the type of credential set to add, "
"select the new Vault integration in the CREDENTIAL STORE field (default "
"selection is \"Internal\")."
msgstr ""
"Con lo anterior proceso finished, este Vault integration será be disponible "
"como un storage destino cuando creating nuevo credential establece. En "
"|InfTruCre|, después de clicking :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR` y selecting el tipo "
"de credential establecer a agregar, seleccionar el nuevo Vault integration "
"en el CREDENTIAL STORE campo (predeterminado selection es \"Interno\")."

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:103
msgid "Installing and Integrating an External Cypher Appliance"
msgstr "Installing y Integrating un Externo Cypher Appliance"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:105
msgid ""
"The external Cypher appliance runs on a small separate VM and supports a "
"variety of base OS distributions. Credentials are securely passed to the "
"external appliance and can be retrieved and consumed in specific places "
"within |morpheus| UI. The download URL for the installer can be retrieved "
"from |morpheus| `Hub <https://app.morpheushub.com/>`_, replace the "
"placeholder URL in the instructions below with the correct URL for the "
"latest version of the Cypher appliance."
msgstr ""
"El externo Cypher appliance ejecuta en un pequeño separate VM y soporta un "
"variety de base OS distributions. Credenciales son securely passed al "
"externo appliance y puede be retrieved y consumed en específico places "
"dentro de |morpheus| UI. El descargar URL para el installer puede be "
"retrieved desde |morpheus| `Hub <https://app.morpheushub.com/>`_, replace el"
" placeholder URL en el instructions a continuación con el correct URL para "
"el latest versión del Cypher appliance."

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:107
msgid ""
"Begin by provisioning and updating the VM for the Cypher appliance. Then, "
"download the installer. The following steps go through the installation "
"process on Ubuntu but, as mentioned in the previous paragraph, many popular "
"distributions are supported."
msgstr ""
"Begin por provisioning y updating el VM para el Cypher appliance. Entonces, "
"descargar el installer. Lo siguiente pasos go a través de el installation "
"proceso en Ubuntu pero, como mentioned en el anterior paragraph, muchos "
"popular distributions son soportados."

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:109
msgid ""
"# An example URL is shown below, find the URL for the latest version and for the correct distro at |morpheus| Hub\n"
"wget https://downloads.morpheusdata.com/path/to/morpheus-cypher_$version_amd64.deb"
msgstr ""
"# Un ejemplo URL es mostrado a continuación, encontrar el URL para el latest versión y para el correct distro en |morpheus| Hub\n"
"wget https://downloads.morpheusdata.com/path/to/morpheus-cypher_$version_amd64.deb"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:114
msgid "Next, install and reconfigure the package."
