#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:154
msgid "Key Pairs"
msgstr "Clave Pairs"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:156
msgid ""
"The key pairs section enables the following actions: Add and Delete key "
"pairs. Key pairs are commonly used by |morpheus| for accessing instances via"
" SSH. |morpheus| stores key pairs to simplify administration and access "
"across both private and public clouds."
msgstr ""
"El clave pairs sección habilita lo siguiente acciones: Agregar y Eliminar "
"clave pairs. Clave pairs son commonly utilizado por |morpheus| para "
"accessing instances via SSH. |morpheus| stores clave pairs a simplify "
"administration y acceso a través de ambos privado y público clouds."

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:158
msgid ""
"|morpheus| only accepts key pairs in PEM format (for example, a private key "
"beginning with ``-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----``). If you have a key in "
"another format, such as OpenSSH, convert the key:"
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| solo accepts clave pairs en PEM format (por ejemplo, un privado "
"clave beginning con ``-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----``). Si you tienen un "
"clave en another format, como OpenSSH, convert el clave:"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:160
msgid ""
"#No passphrase\n"
"ssh-keygen -m pem -f /path/to/key\n"
"\n"
"#With passphrase\n"
"ssh-keygen -p -P \"old passphrase\" -N \"new passphrase\" -m pem -f path/to/key"
msgstr ""
"#No passphrase\n"
"ssh-keygen -m pem -f /ruta/a/clave\n"
"\n"
"#Con passphrase\n"
"ssh-keygen -p -P \"antiguo passphrase\" -N \"nuevo passphrase\" -m pem -f ruta/a/clave"

