#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:232
msgid "Trust Integrations"
msgstr "Trust Integrations"

#: ../../infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.rst:234
msgid ""
"This area lists integrations with external services to manage secrets, keys,"
" and certificates. New Cypher integrations can be created here. See `our "
"guide "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.html#installing-"
"and-integrating-an-external-cypher-appliance>`_ on installing and "
"integrating an external Cypher store for full details. Additionally, some "
"other external trust services may be populated here, such as NSX certificate"
" services."
msgstr ""
"Este area lists integrations con externo servicios a manage secrets, claves,"
" y certificados. Nuevo Cypher integrations se puede crear aquí. Ver `nuestro"
" guide "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/infrastructure/keypairs_certificates/keypairs_certs.html#installing-"
"and-integrating-an-external-cypher-appliance>`_ en installing y integrating "
"un externo Cypher store para completo details. Adicionalmente, algunos otro "
"externo trust servicios puede be populated aquí, como NSX certificado "
"servicios."
